Error [jet.MissingPageFunction]: Convention file `routes_bracket/Docs/[...slug].jet` has an unsupported bracket part `[...slug]`
  --> tests/ui/web_app_routes_bracket.jet:4:22
    |
  4 | fn run() { web.app().routes(from: "routes_bracket").csr().serve() }
    |                      ^^^^^^
 Why: A bracket part must be one whole `[name]` that captures one address part
 Fix: Rename the part to `[name]`, such as `[id]`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2806
